{"bleveBackend.TotalDocs() iterates over b.cache without holding cacheMu, which can panic with concurrent map iteration and map write when BuildIndex() writes to b.cache concurrently. Guard TotalDocs() with cacheMu.": 0.6699509024620056, "init() launches goroutines that mutate and read outer-scope err and totalBatchesIndexed variables, introducing a data race and potentially returning incorrect errors. Use per-goroutine locals and synchronize the counter.": 0.14021675288677216, "Watch goroutine reads events with v := <-events inside infinite loop, but WatchWriteEvents implementations can close the channel, causing nil receives that may panic in handleEvent or spin. Use for v := range events instead.": 0.15892361104488373, "Integration test is skipped entirely for Postgres, reducing DB-matrix coverage and potentially hiding regressions. Consider linking skip to a tracking issue and using t.Skipf with a more specific message.": 0.33343201875686646}